        "evidence_id": "prior-71359ce34658d6db8f93",
        "relation": "boundary",
        "quote": "2026受托人摘要列2025实际：OASI收入12488亿美元、支出14488亿美元，准备金下降2000亿美元；DI和HI当年则有盈余，年底仍向约6230万OASI及820万DI受益人付款。",
        "publication_date": null,
        "observation_end": null,
        "limitation": "OASI当年收入低于支出可视为缓冲压力信号，但仍在持续付款，且DI/HI有盈余，不能证明整体功能达极限；日期未知。"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "prior-c0c8213343a393e3eaea",
        "relation": "support",
        "quote": "HUD报告2024年1月单夜无家可归者超过77万，比2023增18%；家庭上升但退伍军人无家可归有所改善。",
        "publication_date": "2024-12-27",
        "observation_end": "2024-01-01",
        "limitation": "单年无家可归上升支持“否定力量增多”分项，但仅一个指标、一个时点，且退伍军人分项改善。"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-1f39286ba4cf775b42aa8eb8",
        "relation": "support",
        "quote": "745,652 people were homeless, including 266,320 people living on the street on a single night in January 2025 – a 27% increase since 2013 and a 3% decrease since 2024",
        "publication_date": "2026-05-29",
        "observation_end": "2025-01-01",
        "limitation": "长期上升支持否定力量增多，但较2024年下降3%，方向并非单向；且仅无家可归一个指标。"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-78f4f2263208d0c468f5fddd",
        "relation": "counter",
        "quote": "The official poverty rate fell 0.4 percentage points to 10.6% in 2024.",
        "publication_date": "2025-09-09",
        "observation_end": "2024-12-31",
        "limitation": "官方贫困率下降与“否定力量持续增多”分项相反，但SPM为12.9%且与2023无统计差异，指标口径不同。"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-b6a72912337b22b18bf69f7a",
